an5.35:2.3 starts: the good self-controlled monks always resort
an5.35:2.4 starts: always resort to one.
an5.8:2.4 starts: (2) A bhikkhu who has a sense of moral shame
an5.8:2.5 starts: (3) A bhikkhu who has moral dread …
sn44.7:2.18 starts: “Vaccha, the Blessed One has not declared this either: ‘The soul is one
sn44.7:2.19 starts: “How is it,
sn44.7:2.22 starts: “Then, Master Moggallana, does the Tathagata not exist
sn44.7:2.25 starts: “How is it, then, Master Moggallana, does the Tathagata both
sn44.7:2.28 starts: “Then, Master Moggallana, does the Tathagata neither exist
